{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b94cf35ecf74e02b","type":"text","text":"Mensaje audit \n```sh\nnode bin/examples/client-perte.js 974130021 0x2E19CFDA300B3F385A343536754B33324B572E7E audit -pl '{\"id\":[974130021,6000,1,26,0],\"ty\":\"audit\",\"d\":[[1773220600,530,0,2,1,1]]}' -v\n```","x":4255,"y":888,"width":472,"height":203},
		{"id":"a2a0fb88862df9b4","type":"text","text":"[[AKO 44 - Flujo de cambio de parámetros Cloud - Device.canvas]]","x":-1800,"y":-552,"width":297,"height":78},
		{"id":"a06779c827f605ba","type":"text","text":"### 1. Primer envío (API → Device)\n\n*Cambio de configuración mediante *\n`api/src/controllers/api/configuration/send-amqp/endConfig12830`","x":-1651,"y":-185,"width":326,"height":171},
		{"id":"7b10b95462a4505b","type":"text","text":"***backlog.perte mediator***\n\nrecibe el mensaje de la API, lo valida y clasifica, y luego lo reenvía al statecontroller\n\n\n","x":-1240,"y":-185,"width":300,"height":171},
		{"id":"76eb3bf9c33fdd6d","type":"text","text":"\n\n***backlog.perte stateController***\n\n`handleNewConfiguration`\ncrea/actualiza el backlog en la BD: a `pending`","x":-800,"y":-185,"width":300,"height":171},
		{"id":"3ca9cd6e3e18b0af","type":"text","text":"Translator\n\n`handleOutput()`\n- Parsea el mensaje del backlog\n- Convierte los parámetros a formato CoAP (registros MODBUS del dispositivo)\n- Guarda en MongoDB con `storeOutput()` → crea documento en `outputMsg` con status `PENDING`\n- Envía** por primera vez: `sendEvent(\"cl.output.perte.coap.driver\", toCLMessage)` → esto baja al CL (Communication Layer) que envía por CoAP al dispositivo","x":-285,"y":-185,"width":285,"height":171},
		{"id":"b047fbf2d5cad9e6","type":"text","text":"CL","x":440,"y":-129,"width":140,"height":60},
		{"id":"b03a65f0d3196537","type":"text","text":"Device","x":728,"y":-129,"width":140,"height":60},
		{"id":"f7aeb8ac2f7066e2","type":"text","text":"cmd_ack_error","x":427,"y":365,"width":145,"height":50},
		{"id":"a45afb374b5b307a","type":"text","text":"cmd_ack","x":450,"y":279,"width":105,"height":50},
		{"id":"7552f512fb1966dc","type":"text","text":"Translator\n\n`handleInput()`\nProcesa el mensaje Busca pending si el mensaje no es `ACK`: getPendingOutputMessage()\nSi hay PENDING → reenvía el comando al device\nupdateRetries() incrementa contador\nSi max_retries → emite \"12830.output.failed\" y cancela\n    → Si no → sendEvent(\"cl.output.perte.coap.driver\", outputMsg)","x":685,"y":279,"width":285,"height":171},
		{"id":"e478a795281620dd","type":"text","text":"`outputMsg` con status `PENDING`","x":-55,"y":269,"width":245,"height":60},
		{"id":"e937f1315240b810","type":"text","text":"Retry x 3","x":45,"y":479,"width":120,"height":58},
		{"id":"792ef8f7b927172b","type":"text","text":"Otros : Sample, Events ...","x":420,"y":479,"width":160,"height":58},
		{"id":"e9f97744d621e7e1","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20260311110411.png]]\n\n![[Pasted image 20260311113603.png]]","x":182,"y":-14,"width":516,"height":218},
		{"id":"cadb246428d5403c","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20260311103403.png]]\n\n![[Pasted image 20260311103427.png]]","x":-119,"y":569,"width":449,"height":222},
		{"id":"5f9ba7738b33f7f8","type":"text","text":"\n![[Pasted image 20260311103914.png]]\n\n![[Pasted image 20260311103848.png]]","x":-105,"y":860,"width":421,"height":270},
		{"id":"67b10b69199e36aa","type":"text","text":">[!tip] Ejemplo\n\nEjemplo el dispositivo se queda sin cobertura y al recuperarla este ahora tiene otra ip y al reconectarse este lo primero que haria seria enviar los datos acumulados","x":685,"y":537,"width":360,"height":116},
		{"id":"19345539d93a5f84","type":"text","text":"ejemplo de envio `cmd_ack`\n```js\nnode bin/examples/client-perte.js 974130021 <uuid> cmd_ack -v\n```","x":1100,"y":317,"width":280,"height":96},
		{"id":"9ea66424de53af69","type":"text","text":"Cuando aplica el cambio de parámetro genera un mensaje `ty: \"audit\"` informando del cambio.","x":798,"y":-400,"width":366,"height":86},
		{"id":"f3e53fbb9f4622bb","type":"text","text":">[!error] Error\n\n>Si el dispositivo esta en un estado diferente de `\"online\", \"error\", \"registered\"` no puede recibir mensajes","x":-747,"y":968,"width":380,"height":100},
		{"id":"87545b76034fdaa9","type":"text","text":"Primera comunicación \n\n![[Pasted image 20260311100103.png]]\n\n![[Pasted image 20260311100123.png]]","x":-815,"y":600,"width":515,"height":318},
		{"id":"ae92cc5faa4935c8","type":"text","text":"***backlog.perte stateController***\n\n`handleConfirmation`\nCuando llega Confirmación `cmd_ack` actualiza el backlog de `\"pending\"` a `\"send\"`:\nEl `cmd_ack` confirma que el dispositivo **recibió** el comando, pero aún no confirma que lo **aplicó**.\n\n\n\n","x":-650,"y":214,"width":300,"height":171},
		{"id":"294faa19c3b69bd5","type":"text","text":"Crear el backlog de `\"pending\"`","x":-1120,"y":325,"width":250,"height":54},
		{"id":"070b60bd71e40b77","type":"text","text":"***backlog.perte stateController***\n\n`handleAudit`\nauditProcessor.processAuditMessag\n   → Crea el audit en la BD\n   → Actualiza la conf actual del device\n   → Devuelve el audit con { ref, newValue, device, ... }\n2. Si el resultado tiene \"ref\" (línea 157):\n   → backlogProcessor.confirmAudit() (línea 159)\n   → Busca backlog en status \"send\"\n   → Compara ref + newValue\n   → Si match → \"confirmed\"\n","x":-800,"y":-480,"width":300,"height":171},
		{"id":"922620a6f3487ab5","type":"text","text":"condición para borrar/deshabilitar el dispositivo\n\n`530 = 2` (`param_lic_sys_state = 2`)","x":-1240,"y":-660,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1dc845723deaf05c","type":"text","text":"```sh \nnode bin/examples/client-perte.js 974130021 0x2E19CFDA300B3F385A343536754B33324B572E7E audit -pl '{\"id\":[974130021,6000,1,26,0],\"ty\":\"audit\",\"d\":[['\"$(date +%s)\"',530,0,2,1,1]]}' -v\n```","x":290,"y":-671,"width":395,"height":201},
		{"id":"ec01051a3bacd453","type":"text","text":">[!success]\n\n>Se realiza el cambio de parámetro","x":-1488,"y":-340,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"38bdbc059545e10c","type":"text","text":">[!warning] Atención! Renvio de parametros sin contestación del Device\n\nSi volvemos a renviar cambios de parámetros cuando el Device no a constestado, el `translator` añadira esos cambios al `outputMessage` pero no hace reintentos ","x":-1800,"y":84,"width":420,"height":185}
	],
